RUNNNING TESTS
==============

In order to run these tests cd into project root directory then run
"make test" (this is also valid for Windows).

FTPMC regressions
=================

Run "python -m pytest tests/test_mc.py" for the multiple-connection tests.
These include restart offsets, removal of stale tails before new writes,
ASCII conversion, partial file writes and preservation of the file prefix
after the receiving process is killed. The latter resumes in a new session
with a different connection count and stripe size, using only SIZE and the
retained file.
